00:19:22.880 --> 00:19:24.040
It's Ellie.

00:19:24.040 --> 00:19:25.410
She was kidnapped!

00:19:25.410 --> 00:19:26.900
Huh?

00:19:26.900 --> 00:19:28.800
By who?

00:19:30.160 --> 00:19:32.020
A psycho named Lance.

00:19:32.020 --> 00:19:35.140
I have to go, sword or no sword.

00:19:35.140 --> 00:19:38.060
Ellie is my friend and she's counting on me to come and help her.

00:19:38.060 --> 00:19:39.800
I can't let her down.

00:19:39.800 --> 00:19:41.440
I'll do whatever it takes.

00:19:41.440 --> 00:19:46.370
Come on, this Lance guy's a real monster.

00:19:46.370 --> 00:19:50.460
I can't believe this kid would risk his life like this.

00:19:50.460 --> 00:19:54.980
He can't begin to imagine what Lance is truly capable of.

00:19:54.980 --> 00:19:58.170
Finally, you've finished the sword, Musica.

00:19:58.170 --> 00:20:00.000
A job well done.

00:20:00.940 --> 00:20:03.060
I think I'll take it for a little test drive.

00:20:04.540 --> 00:20:04.900
No!

00:20:09.090 --> 00:20:12.020
Haru, we bring the rave to Lance.

00:20:12.430 --> 00:20:13.840
I'll bring it, all right.

00:20:14.210 --> 00:20:16.460
Let's go, Plu.

00:20:16.840 --> 00:20:17.460
Wait a minute.

00:20:18.020 --> 00:20:23.470
No one but a fool would confront Lance with a broken sword.

00:20:25.200 --> 00:20:28.190
But it's the only sword I've got.

00:20:28.500 --> 00:20:30.000
Then it must be repaired.

00:20:30.600 --> 00:20:39.980
so you'll help us i'll find that steady hand one last time you see i lost my purpose long ago

00:20:40.430 --> 00:20:51.730
but now you've made it clear to me exactly what it is that i have to do so then it's been 15 years

00:20:52.200 --> 00:21:00.000
since these hands pounded iron now i swear on the name musica i'll use all my powers

00:21:00.060 --> 00:21:01.640
to fix this sword.

00:21:03.050 --> 00:21:09.470
Excellent. You have one hour

00:21:09.470 --> 00:21:17.020
left and counting. This is

00:21:17.020 --> 00:21:19.200
going to be epic. I'll

00:21:19.200 --> 00:21:21.080
finally get my hands on the rave.

00:21:22.730 --> 00:21:24.050
Next time

00:21:24.050 --> 00:21:25.990
on Ravemaster. The broken

00:21:25.990 --> 00:21:27.990
sword can't be repaired in half an

00:21:27.990 --> 00:21:30.000
hour. It takes time. We don't

00:21:30.190 --> 00:21:32.750
time. At least life is in danger.

00:21:32.750 --> 00:21:36.880
Haru's putting all his faith in that old man, and for all we know, he's a fake.

00:21:36.880 --> 00:21:41.360
Don't move! Tell me what you're doing here!

00:21:41.360 --> 00:21:44.820
If it doesn't finish in time, I'm gonna have to go there without it.
